#: configdialog.cpp:109
msgid ""
"<qt>There are two different clipboard buffers available:<br><br>The "
"<b>Clipboard</b>, that you fill by selecting something<br>and pressing Ctrl-"
"C or by pressing \"Copy\" in a tool- or<br>menubar.<br><br>And the "
"<b>Selection</b>, that is available immediately after<br>selecting some "
"text. The only way to access the selection<br>is to press the middle mouse "
"button.<br><br>Selecting this option synchronizes those two buffers, so "
"they<br>work the same way as in KDE 1.x and 2.x</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Co' hai loa.i vu`ng dde^.m clipboard co' the^? du`ng:<br><br>"
"<b>Clipboard</b>, la` ca'i ba.n se~ la^'p dda^`y pha^`n cho.n ba(`ng mo^.t ca'i gi` ddo'<br> va` nha^'n"
"Ctrl - c hay nha^'n \"Copy\" tu+` co^ng cu. hay <br> thu+.c ddo+n <br><br>"
"va` loa.i  <b>Lu+.a cho.n</b>, hu+~u hie^.u ngay la^.p tu+'c sau khii <br>cho.n text na`o ddo' . "
"Ca'ch duy nha^t dde^? truy ca^.p Lu+.a Cho.n la` <br>nha^'n va`o nu't chuo^.t giu+~a"
".<br><br> Nha^.n tuy` cho.n na`y se~ ddo^`ng ki` ca? hai vu`ng dde^.m , va` chu'ng"
"<br> se~ la`m vie^.c gio^'ng nhau trong KDE 1.x va `KDE 2.x</qt>"

